/*
  MediaNowPlayingWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0063 · MediaNowPlayingWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `MediaNowPlayingWidget` resolves (table "MediaNowPlayingWidget") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first three keys are the exact strings extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/MediaNowPlayingWidget.tsx). The remaining keys back
  the native-only chrome (registry description, freshness chip, retry/empty/error
  copy, accessibility).
*/

